{
  "_comment": [
    "Report 362 — 'Critical_Results_New' (LIS).",
    "Captured from the portal's own GetReportData request, unchanged apart from",
    "the two dates and loginUserId, which the server fills in per request.",
    "Its date parameters are named plain FROM and TO — spelled out in _meta.",
    "Joined by SAMPLE_NO: whether a sample carried a critical result, and when",
    "it was authorised. Its TEST_NAME is the analyte ('...-O2Hb'), finer than",
    "the main report's test, so it joins at the sample and the count of rows",
    "lands alongside — a sample with two critical results says so.",
    "Re-capture it the same way if the HIS ever changes the report's filters."
  ],
